[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0010","text":"多谢款待……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0020","text":"多谢款待！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0030","text":"什锦炒面和八宝菜里\n都放了木耳呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0040","text":"是、是呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0050","text":"哦，这次的新闻在播水族馆的水母专题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0060","text":"哇……好漂亮……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0070","text":"配上灯光看起来更美了……\n大的小的都有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0080","text":"……果然，比起吃\n还是看更好呢，水母这东西……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0090","text":"木耳适合吃\n水母适合看，是吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200200_02_0100","text":"总有一天，我想把两者都好好看一看……！"}]
